{"unit_id": "tag:06L2:proof", "translation": "由于<MATH_0001>是形变范畴（deformation category），它满足 (S1) 和 (S2)，见引理<REF_0001>。由引理<REF_0002>，存在一个通用形式对象（versal formal object）。由引理<REF_0003>，存在引理陈述中的极小通用形式对象（minimal versal formal object）<MATH_0002>。令<MATH_0003>，则关联映射（map）<MATH_0004>是光滑（smooth）的（这就是通用形式对象（versal formal object）的定义）。设<MATH_0005>是函子中的群胚（groupoid in functors），它在引理<REF_0004>中从映射（map）<MATH_0006>构造。由引理<REF_0005>，可知<MATH_0007>是光滑（smooth）的函子中的群胚（groupoid in functors），且<MATH_0008>是等价（equivalence）。由引理<REF_0006>，可知<MATH_0009>是可 pro 表（prorepresentable）的。最后，<MATH_0010>是极小（minimal）的，因为<MATH_0011>对应于极小通用形式对象（minimal versal formal object）<MATH_0012>。\n", "allowed_english": ["S1", "S2"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "deformation category", "target_term": "形变范畴"}, {"source_term": "versal formal object", "target_term": "通用形式对象"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal object", "target_term": "极小通用形式对象"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "versal formal object", "target_term": "通用形式对象"}, {"source_term": "groupoid in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "groupoid in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可 pro 表"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal object", "target_term": "极小通用形式对象"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "deformation category", "target_term": "形变范畴", "context": "本处范畴，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "versal formal object", "target_term": "通用形式对象", "context": "所用形式对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal object", "target_term": "极小通用形式对象", "context": "完整复合概念，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "关联映射，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "映射性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "groupoi