{"unit_id": "tag:06L3:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个在群胚中余纤维化的范畴（category cofibered in groupoids），它位于<MATH_0002>上。假设存在<MATH_0003>的呈示（presentations），由极小（minimal）、光滑（smooth）且可 pro 表（prorepresentable）的函子中的群胚（groupoids in functors）<MATH_0004>及<MATH_0005>给出。那么<MATH_0006>与<MATH_0007>同构（isomorphic）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "category cofibered in groupoids", "target_term": "在群胚中余纤维化的范畴"}, {"source_term": "presentations", "target_term": "呈示"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可 pro 表"}, {"source_term": "groupoids in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "category cofibered in groupoids", "target_term": "在群胚中余纤维化的范畴", "context": "完整复合概念，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "presentations", "target_term": "呈示", "context": "所给呈示，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "可 pro 表", "context": "群胚性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "groupoids in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚", "context": "完整复合概念，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "结论中的关系，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06L3:proof", "translation": "这由引理<REF_0001>，以及如下观察推出：态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>就是函子中的群胚（groupoids in functors）的态射（morphism）（由我们在定义<REF_0002>中对<MATH_0002>的显式构造）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "groupoids in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴态射，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "groupoids in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚", "context": "完整复合概念，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
